        <p>Dear Test,</p>

        <p>We are writing to inform you that your management access for <strong>Australian International School Bangkok, Soi 20 Campus</strong> has been revoked.</p>

        <div class="school-info">
          <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">School Information</h3>
          <p><strong>Name:</strong> Australian International School Bangkok, Soi 20 Campus</p>
